## Purpose

Local non-code knowledge base for role: **{{PRIMARY_ROLE}}**.
Helps AI agents understand the author's context, thinking style, decisions, expertise, and preferences.

## CRITICAL: how the user talks to you

An opening line that names AGENTS.md means: load this base. Read `kb.config.yml`, skim `knowledge/profile/`, `knowledge/principles/`, `knowledge/voice/`, then confirm briefly ("Got it — {{PRIMARY_ROLE}} mode, voice loaded").

